  "html": "<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col col-8\"><h2>Off-Axis Laminator</h2><figure><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Variable-Angle-Off-Axis-Laminator.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><div class=\"center\">\n\t\t\t<ul>\n<li>Cuts parallelogram sheets from composite tape</li>\n<li>Allows fiber angles from 0 to 29 degrees</li>\n<li>Places and heat tacks sheets automatically in the downstream process</li>\n<li>Online width measurement</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div><div class=\"col col-4\">\n\t\t\t<nav class=\"side-nav\"><h3 class=\"widget-title\">Specialty Machines</h3><ul><li class=\"current\"><a href=\"/composites-automation/specialty-machines/off-axis-laminator/\">Off-Axis Laminator</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/specialty-machines/tool-wrapper-and-sealer/\">Tool Wrapper and Sealer</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/specialty-machines/motion-platform-relay-machine/\">Motion Platform / Relay Machine</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/specialty-machines/ndt-ir-camera-motion-platform/\">NDT IR Camera Motion Platform</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/specialty-machines/foam-cutting-machine/\">Foam Cutting Machine</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/specialty-machines/noodle-former-radius-filler/\">Noodle Former / Radius Filler</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/specialty-machines/ply-kitting-machine/\">Ply Kitting Machine</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/specialty-machines/tape-splicer/\">Tape Splicer</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/specialty-machines/thermoplastic-filament-winding/\">Thermoplastic Filament Winding</a></li></ul></nav>\n</div></div><h3>Machine Images</h3><div class=\"gallery\"><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Variable-Angle-Off-Axis-Laminator.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Variable-Angle-Off-Axis-Laminator-300x162.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"162\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div>"
